<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font style="" face="Arial, sans-serif">Hello,&nbsp;</font><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif">It is our&nbsp;understanding that you are currently&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">working with corporate turnaround regarding your account with National Funding.</span></font></div><p dir="auto" style="margin: 0in; line-height: 20px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I am reaching out to advise you that we can offer you the same programs as we would offer them and would like to discuss possible repayment plans with you directly.&nbsp; In our experience dealing with a third party debt settlement company has proven more costly for our customers and as such we have a policy not to communicate with them.&nbsp;</font></p><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Please contact us as soon as possible to work with us on resolving your account and making payment arrangements that are manageable.&nbsp;</span></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">We look forward to hearing from you.</span></font></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><br></font><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial;"><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">{!User.Name} |&nbsp;</font><span style="font-family: arial;">{!User.Title}</span></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><p class="MsoNormal" style="background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><b>{!Case.Email_Signature_Company__c}</b></font></p></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</font></div><div style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</font></div></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><font face="arial">P:&nbsp;{!User.Phone} | F:&nbsp;{!User.Fax}</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;"><span style="font-family: arial;">E:&nbsp;{!User.Email}</span></div></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>